# Local clang-tidy config for benchmarks
# Keep core static-analysis checks but disable two noisy readability checks
# that are common and acceptable in short benchmark code (short loop
# variable names, literal numeric constants used for test vectors, etc.).
Checks: 'cppcoreguidelines-*,bugprone-*,modernize-*,performance-*,-readability-magic-numbers,-readability-identifier-length,-cppcoreguidelines-avoid-magic-numbers'
CheckOptions: []
...
